                          "text": [
                            "Before choosing a\nmechanical\nreplacement, whose\nassigned work must",
                            "occur in the\nexample? The\nresident report is\nreal and should be",
                            "acknowledged. It\ndoes not by itself\nidentify which\npart failed.",
                            "Choose the missing\nverification\nhandoff, so the\nduty register",
                            "protects both the\nresident from\ndelay and the\nbuilder from\nrepairing",
                            "a guess."
